{"text": "HANDOFF NOTES for Keisha - Mossback Outfitters, LLC books\nfrom Trudy Vandermolen, last day Friday 11/14. Sorry this is a brain dump. Shred or lock up when you've moved everything into the password manager!!\n\nOWNER: Corwin Skaggs, cell 406-555-0119, corwin@mossbackoutfitters.example. He answers texts, not email. Shop is 26 East Callender Street, Livingston MT 59047.\nEIN 81-4420871. MT withholding acct 4418772-001-WTH.\n\nBANK - Paradise Valley State Bank\n  operating  1104418772   routing 092662045\n  payroll    1104418780\n  online banking: https://online.pvsb.example/business  user mossback_books  pw Stonefly!Hatch26\n  the token fob is in the top desk drawer. security question (first rod): Sage XP\n  branch contact is Lupe Arredondo, direct 406-555-0184 - she knows Corwin and will call HIM, not you, to verify wires\n\nCOMPANY CARD (in Corwin's name, I keep a copy for online orders)\n  Visa 4304 2404 8340 0526  exp 10/27  cvv 339  billing zip 59047\n  statement closes the 22nd, autopay from operating\n\nPAYROLL - Bitterbrush Payroll Co.  client ID BB-20441\n  login tvandermolen@mossbackoutfitters.example / Elk$Hair#Caddis  -> they need to re-issue under your email\n  4 employees + 3 seasonal guides. Guides are 1099 except the one who is on a J-1 visa (ask Corwin, paperwork in the blue folder)\n  Form 941 filed through Q3. Q4 is yours.\n\nQUICKBOOKS\n  QuickBooks Desktop 2024 lives on the back-office PC, hostname MOSSBACK-BO1, serial on the sticker MXL4418K7Z\n  admin pw Rainbow2Brown. Backups go nightly to the NAS (Synology DS220+, serial 2140QRN441877) at 192.168.10.40\n  remote in through the shop's static IP 203.0.113.212 port 3390 - yes I know. tell him to get a VPN.\n\nVENDORS THAT NEED CARE\n  - Hardy Reel Werkstatt GmbH (the German reel parts). They invoice in euros, usually EUR 3.200,00 or so a quarter. Wire only:\n    IBAN DE19 0289 9499 5185 0830 84   BIC HRWKDEFFXXX. Last one sent 10/06, $3,512.44 incl fee.\n  - rent to the landlord is $2,850 on the 1st by check, he will not take ACH\n\nTHINGS ONLY I KNOW (sorry)\n  - Corwin takes $4,000 owner draw twice a month. In August he took $22,000 extra - that was his divorce settlement payment, code it to draws not legal fees\n  - the $600/mo to \"R. Skaggs\" is his brother, who is in a rehab facility in Billings. Personal. Draws.\n  - sales tax: none (Montana) but the resort tax in West Yellowstone applies to the pop-up, permit WY-RT-0418\n  - my own W-2 will need mailing: 311 South H Street, Livingston. SSN is in the payroll system, ends 8297\n\ncall me if stuck, 406.555.0102, until the end of the month. good luck - T.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "414 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Keisha", "Corwin Skaggs", "Lupe Arredondo", "Corwin", "R. Skaggs", "T."], "companies": ["Mossback Outfitters", "Paradise Valley State Bank", "Bitterbrush Payroll Co", "Hardy Reel Werkstatt GmbH", "Synology", "QuickBooks", "Montana", "West Yellowstone"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Livingston MT", "Mossback Outfitters, LLC", "Paradise Valley State Bank", "Livingston", "Billings", "West Yellowstone"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["CCPA"], "names": ["Corwin", "Keisha", "R.", "T."]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 18, "end": 24, "text": "Keisha", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Keisha"}, {"start": 27, "end": 51, "text": "Mossback Outfitters, LLC", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Mossback Outfitters, LLC"}, {"start": 63, "end": 80, "text": "Trudy